[Unit]
Description=Ares Empire — LLM API key expiry reminder (one-shot)

[Service]
Type=oneshot
WorkingDirectory=/root/ares-empire
ExecStart=/usr/bin/python3 /root/ares-empire/tools/empire notify "⚠️ <b>API key expiry</b> — your NVIDIA/Mistral key for the empire auto-fill is near its ~6-month expiry. Rotate it at build.nvidia.com and update EMPIRE_LLM_KEY in /root/ares-empire/.env."
